  "content": "<h1>不再有驚嚇</h1><p><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Loaders-Fabric/Quilt/NeoForge-lightblue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Versions-1.20.2_|_1.21_|_26.1_|_26.2-lightblue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\">\n<img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Environments-Client-lightblue?style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\"></p><h3>獲得挖掘疲勞時，移除遠古深海守衛的詛咒效果！</h3><ul>\n<li><strong>停用</strong>遠古深海守衛的詛咒粒子彈出特效 <em>以及</em> 詛咒音效</li>\n<li>此模組<strong>僅</strong>停用驚嚇效果，<strong>並非</strong>移除挖掘疲勞效果</li>\n<li>純粹的<em>客戶端</em>模組，<strong>無需伺服器端功能</strong></li>\n</ul><h4>如有任何問題或功能請求，請於 <a href=\"https://github.com/CoolAid48/NoMoreJumpscares/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 提交回報</h4><p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fcoolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在 Ko-fi 上贊助我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/donate/kofi-singular-alt_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/J2SGshKNah\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在 Discord 與我聊天\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/discord-plural_vector.svg\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://www.twitch.tv/coolaid48\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"在 Twitch 上觀看我\" src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@intergrav/devins-badges@3.2.0/assets/cozy/social/twitch-singular_vector.svg\"></a></p><h2>在尋找伺服器主機嗎？</h2><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8e85210a65b7c17998987c57b7571ba2fbd19bfb.png\" alt=\"伺服器主機合作夥伴\"></p>",
